{"capturado_en": "2026-11-11T22:36:26+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Warface: Clutch", "steam_appid": 291480, "required_age": "13", "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/291480/extras/5a54b8a583a85820d249df46079f8406.avif?t=1772125417\" width=780 height=202 /></span><br><strong>The bells toll above ancient walls, calling fighters back to the battlefield. Behind iron gates and towering ramparts lies the impregnable Stronghold, where General Wharton is held captive by the shadowy organization known as the Labyrinth.<br><br>Bring the brave General Wharton home in the new Echoes of Valor season, which offers two Special Operations and numerous activities. Also, get ready for major UI and gameplay improvements for clearer, smoother navigation, progression, and combat.<br><br>The stones of this medieval city remember every battle. Are you brave enough to take up its challenge?</strong></h2><strong>New Content</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>New PvE Season with the Unbreakable Guard Weapon Series<br></li><li>New Battle Pass with the Stained Glass, Noble Carving, and Gothic Stone Weapon Series<br></li><li>New RM Season with the Nobility Weapon Series<br></li><li>New Prestige Season</li></ul><strong>Content Changes</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Progression Improvements<br></li><li>UI Enhancements<br></li><li>Warface+: Doubling the Bonuses</li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>Warface: Clutch is a contemporary MMO first person shooter with millions of fans around the world. It offers intense PvP modes, compelling PvE missions and raids that you can challenge with five diverse classes and a colossal customizable arsenal.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loo